{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","descriptor":{"availability":"bundled","byte_size":36864,"locations":["https://archive.org/details/devotional-prayers-multitradition-baseline"],"media_type":"application/json","retrieved_at":"2026-08-28T00:00:00Z","sha256":"pinned-devotional-baseline-v1"},"institution":"mw:institution:interreligious-liturgy-heritage","language":"mul","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline","rights":{"attribution":"Classical public domain prayers, mantras, and devotional texts across world traditions.","license_expression":"CC0-1.0","redistribution":"permitted","status":"public_domain"}}},"id":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","kind":"source.snapshot","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"Devotional, Prayer, and Practice Baseline Artifact"}],"record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"textual":{"delimiter":":","units":["tradition","item"],"work":"mw:work:devotional:baseline"}},"id":"mw:citation-scheme:devotional:tradition-item","kind":"textual.citation_scheme","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"Tradition-item devotional citation scheme"}],"record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:devotional:buddhism:karaniya-metta-chanting:source","language":"en","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:devotional:buddhism:karaniya-metta-chanting","text":"May all beings be happy and secure. Even as a mother protects with her life her child, her only child, so too for all creatures unfold a boundless heart."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:buddhism:karaniya-metta-chanting:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:devotional:buddhism:karaniya-metta-chanting:source","language":"id","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:devotional:buddhism:karaniya-metta-chanting","text":"Semoga semua makhluk berbahagia dan tentram. Sebagaimana seorang ibu melindungi anaknya yang tunggal dengan jiwanya, demikian pula terhadap semua makhluk kembangkanlah batin tanpa batas."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:buddhism:karaniya-metta-chanting:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"genre":"chant","language":"pli-Latn","representation":"source","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:devotional:buddhism:karaniya-metta-chanting","text":"Sabbe sattā bhavantu sukhitattā. Mātā yathā niyaṁ puttaṁ āyusā ekaputtamanurakkhe, evampi sabbabhūtesu mānasaṁ bhāvaye aparimāṇaṁ."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:buddhism:karaniya-metta-chanting:source","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:devotional:christianity:lords-prayer:source","language":"en","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:devotional:christianity:lords-prayer","text":"Our Father in heaven, hallowed be your name. Your kingdom come, your will be done, on earth as it is in heaven..."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:christianity:lords-prayer:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:devotional:christianity:lords-prayer:source","language":"id","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:devotional:christianity:lords-prayer","text":"Bapa kami yang di sorga, Dikuduskanlah nama-Mu, datanglah Kerajaan-Mu, jadilah kehendak-Mu di bumi seperti di sorga..."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:christianity:lords-prayer:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"genre":"prayer","language":"grc","representation":"source","script":"Grek","target":"mw:passage:devotional:christianity:lords-prayer","text":"Πάτερ ἡμῶν ὁ ἐν τοῖς οὐρανοῖς, ἁγιασθήτω τὸ ὄνομά σου· ἐλθέτω ἡ βασιλεία σου· γενηθήτω τὸ θέλημά σου, ὡς ἐν οὐρανῷ καὶ ἐπὶ γῆς..."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:christianity:lords-prayer:source","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:devotional:hinduism:gayatri-mantra:source","language":"en","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:devotional:hinduism:gayatri-mantra","text":"Om, the physical, subtle, and celestial realms. Let us meditate on that supreme effulgence of the divine Savitur; may that inspire our intellect."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:hinduism:gayatri-mantra:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:devotional:hinduism:gayatri-mantra:source","language":"id","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:devotional:hinduism:gayatri-mantra","text":"Om, alam fisik, batin, dan surgawi. Marilah kita bermeditasi pada cahaya gemilang Savitur yang ilahi; semoga membimbing dan menerangi pikiran kita."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:hinduism:gayatri-mantra:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"genre":"mantra","language":"sa","representation":"source","script":"Deva","target":"mw:passage:devotional:hinduism:gayatri-mantra","text":"ॐ भूर्भुवः स्वः तत्सवितुर्वरेण्यं भर्गो देवस्य धीमहि धियो यो नः प्रचोदयात् ॥"}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:hinduism:gayatri-mantra:source","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:devotional:islam:sayyid-al-istighfar:source","language":"en","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:devotional:islam:sayyid-al-istighfar","text":"O Allah, You are my Lord, there is no deity worthy of worship except You. You created me and I am Your servant, and I abide by Your covenant and promise as much as I am able..."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:islam:sayyid-al-istighfar:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:devotional:islam:sayyid-al-istighfar:source","language":"id","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:devotional:islam:sayyid-al-istighfar","text":"Ya Allah, Engkau adalah Tuhanku, tidak ada sesembahan yang berhak disembah selain Engkau. Engkau telah menciptakanku dan aku adalah hamba-Mu, dan aku senantiasa berada dalam perjanjian dan janji-Mu semampuku..."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:islam:sayyid-al-istighfar:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"genre":"prayer","language":"ar","representation":"source","script":"Arab","target":"mw:passage:devotional:islam:sayyid-al-istighfar","text":"اللَّهُمَّ أَنْتَ رَبِّي لاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ أَنْتَ، خَلَقْتَنِي وَأَنَا عَبْدُكَ، وَأَنَا عَلَى عَهْدِكَ وَوَعْدِكَ مَا اسْتَطَعْتُ، أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّ مَا صَنَعْتُ..."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:islam:sayyid-al-istighfar:source","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:devotional:judaism:shema-yisrael:source","language":"en","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:devotional:judaism:shema-yisrael","text":"Hear, O Israel: The LORD our God, the LORD is one."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:judaism:shema-yisrael:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:devotional:judaism:shema-yisrael:source","language":"id","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:devotional:judaism:shema-yisrael","text":"Dengarlah, hai orang Israel: TUHAN itu Allah kita, TUHAN itu esa."}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:judaism:shema-yisrael:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:devotional:baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:devotional:baseline"},"textual":{"genre":"prayer","language":"he","representation":"source","script":"Hebr","target":"mw:passage:devotional:judaism:shema-yisrael","text":"שְׁמַع יִשְׂרָאֵל יְהוָה אֱלֹהֵינוּ יְהוָה אֶחָד׃"}},"id":"mw:content:devotional:judaism:shema-yisrael:source","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
